        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-559 (ensure controlled execution — Freight Sourcing, Carrier Contracting &amp; Rate Management (PA-110.1).) | - operational: routing-guide authority documented; spot exceptions approved and logged per lane
Owner: Logistics / Transportation</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
