      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: PO placement (links to VS-03.2); routing guide (W3500)
Frequency: Per PO + continuous
Volume: ~72K inbound receipts/year
Owner: Logistics / Procurement
Participants: Logistics (links to VS-06/VS-04), Procurement (links to VS-03), Vendor (links to VS-03.4 portal), DC Operations (links to VS-04), AP (links to VS-15)
Source: workflow W3502 — Inbound Freight Management &amp; Vendor Routing Compliance</bpmn:documentation>
