        <bpmn:outgoing>W3502_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3502_Task4" name="Logistics/Procurement set inbound routing terms per PO: BuildRight-controlled…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Logistics/Procurement set inbound routing terms per PO: BuildRight-controlled freight (collect/own routing guide W3500) vs prepaid/vendor-controlled, incoterm (links to VS-87/W2560), and vendor routing instructions (carrier, mode, packaging, appointment links to VS-04/W585); communicate via the vendor portal (links to VS-03.4) and PO
Responsible (R): Logistics / Procurement / Vendor
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager
Duration: Per PO</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3502_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3502_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3502_Task5" name="Logistics/Vendor manage inbound execution: ASN (links to VS-03.4), pickup…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Logistics/Vendor manage inbound execution: ASN (links to VS-03.4), pickup scheduling, in-transit visibility (W3508), dock appointment (links to VS-04/W585), and receiving (links to VS-04.1/W1365); manage DSD bulky freight (cement/lumber/sand per profile §7.1) and direct-store appointments
Responsible (R): Logistics / Vendor / DC
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager
Duration: Per PO</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3502_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3502_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3502_Task6" name="Logistics/AP manage inbound freight cost responsibility and chargeback…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Logistics/AP manage inbound freight cost responsibility and chargeback: collect-vs-prepaid reconciliation, vendor non-compliance chargeback (off-guide, late, packaging links to VS-03/W245), freight cost capture to landed cost (W3515), and dispute resolution (links to VS-90); report vendor routing compliance (W3512)
Responsible (R): Logistics / AP
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager / Finance
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3502_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3502_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3502_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3502_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
