    <bpmn:process id="W_W3504" name="W3504. Carrier Onboarding, Insurance &amp; Regulatory Compliance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Carrier award (W3498); onboarding cycle
Frequency: Per carrier + periodic re-qualification
Volume: Carrier/3PL base
Owner: Procurement / Logistics
Participants: Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-34), Logistics (links to VS-06), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Insurance/Risk (links to VS-26), HSE (links to VS-24), Compliance (links to VS-22/VS-87), Master Data (links to VS-29)
Source: workflow W3504 — Carrier Onboarding, Insurance &amp; Regulatory Compliance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3504_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3504_Lane1" name="Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3504_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3504_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3504_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3504_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3504_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3504_Start3" name="Carrier award (W3498); onboarding cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3504_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3504_Task4" name="Procurement/Logistics onboard the carrier/3PL: business registration (SEC/DTI)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Procurement/Logistics onboard the carrier/3PL: business registration (SEC/DTI), tax (BIR links to VS-79), transport franchise/CPC/LTFRB for trucks, customs accreditation where import-relevant (links to VS-87), driver/vehicle accreditation (links to W1373), insurance certificates (cargo, CTPL, third-party links to VS-26), and HSE/safety record (links to VS-24)
Responsible (R): Procurement / Logistics / Compliance
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager
Duration: Per carrier</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3504_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3504_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3504_Task5" name="Procurement/Master Data set up the carrier in the vendor master (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Procurement/Master Data set up the carrier in the vendor master (links to VS-29/W16), Oracle Transportation Execution rate master (links to W3499/W1166), EDI/API integration (links to VS-27), bank/payment (links to VS-15/VS-18), and the routing guide (W3500); validate rate and capability
Responsible (R): Procurement / Master Data / IT
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager
Duration: Per carrier</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3504_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3504_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3504_Task6" name="Procurement/Insurance maintain ongoing compliance: insurance renewal tracking…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Procurement/Insurance maintain ongoing compliance: insurance renewal tracking (links to VS-26), franchise/accreditation renewals, safety/regulatory updates (links to VS-22/VS-24), periodic re-qualification, and offboarding (deactivate, final settlement, data per privacy links to VS-91); feed the carrier scorecard (W3512)
Responsible (R): Procurement / Insurance / Compliance
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3504_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3504_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3504_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3504_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3504_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-78 (ensure freight invoice accuracy &amp; carrier compliance.) | - operational: insurance tracking (links to VS-26); operational: renewal tracking
Owner: Procurement / Logistics</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3504_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3504_Annotation8" targetRef="W3504_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
